      "source": [
        "# Order Failure & Customer Dissatisfaction Root-Cause Analysis\n",
        "## GenAI Review Root-Cause Classification\n",
        "\n",
        "### 01. Project Objective\n",
        "\n",
        "This notebook takes the **negative Olist reviews** (review_score ≤ 2) exported from the\n",
        "SQL layer and classifies each review's **primary root cause** using a controlled taxonomy,\n",
        "via an LLM with structured JSON output.\n",
        "\n",
        "**Scope of this notebook — and what it is deliberately NOT doing:**\n",
        "\n",
        "- It does **not** build or touch the SQL layer (already complete).\n",
        "- It does **not** build the Power BI dashboard.\n",
        "- It does **not** calculate financial impact.\n",
        "- It does **not** perform seller/category prioritization.\n",
        "- It does **not** generate business recommendations.\n",
        "\n",
        "**The LLM's job, precisely:** unstructured customer review text → structured root-cause\n",
        "information (`primary_cause`, `secondary_cause`, `severity`, `confidence`, `evidence`).\n",
        "Nothing more.\n",
        "\n",
        "**Important business limitation, stated up front:** Olist does not contain actual\n",
        "return/refund transactions. Everything classified here is a **negative review**, not a\n",
        "confirmed return. The LLM's output is an *inference from text*, subject to error — which is\n",
        "exactly why this notebook includes a manual validation stage (Sections 13–16).\n"
      ],
      "id": "AsN2FrfPv7Jk"
    },
